---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description: "I'm a starter theme for Astro.build",
	title: "About",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<h1 class="title mb-12">About</h1>
	<div class="prose prose-sm prose-cactus max-w-none">
		<p>
		  I'm Douglas Jarquin. I live in Davie, FL, where I wrangle servers and code.
		</p>
		<p>
      I’ve loved solving technical puzzles for as long as I can remember. I started my career configuring CAD systems for a machine shop, where I learned the importance of making technology work seamlessly with complex processes.
    </p>
    <p>
      My passion for helping people and scaling systems really took off in 2004, when I moved on to building websites for client. I loved the challenge of ensuring uptime and performance, even during unexpected traffic spikes, and it sort of become my niche.
    </p>
    <p>
      Today, I’m the Director of DevOps at Zumba Fitness, where I lead a team of engineers and operations professionals to ensure the smooth operation of our global platform.
    </p>
    <p>
      My journey has always been about finding elegant solutions to technical challenges — and geniunely excited to wake up and tackle new challenges every day.
    </p>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
